.TH tutsort 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tutsort \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tutsort
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tutsort ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tutsort command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tutsort. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tutsort(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tutsort.tcl ...
.fi
